    "text_labels": {
      "0": {
        "x": 60,
        "y": 67,
        "text": "V-ATPase: knockout propagation works; growth is unchanged"
      },
      "1": {
        "x": 60,
        "y": 112,
        "text": "iYali26 | Screened GPR candidate | SD-Leu / PO1f | 21 September 2026"
      },
      "2": {
        "x": 60,
        "y": 167,
        "text": "WT growth 1.87188 h-1    |    All 14 target single KOs ~100% of WT    |    Essential calls (<15%): 116 -> 116"
      },
      "3": {
        "x": 75,
        "y": 230,
        "text": "A. Current reaction context"
      },
      "4": {
        "x": 100,
        "y": 272,
        "text": "CYTOSOL [cy]"
      },
      "5": {
        "x": 1005,
        "y": 272,
        "text": "GOLGI [go]"
      },
      "6": {
        "x": 995,
        "y": 657,
        "text": "VACUOLE [va]"
      },
      "7": {
        "x": 255,
        "y": 885,
        "text": "R795: bounds [0,0]; already closed before knockout"
      },
      "8": {
        "x": 85,
        "y": 930,
        "text": "All drawn WT fluxes = 0. Arrows show stored directionality, not positive flux."
      },
      "9": {
        "x": 85,
        "y": 962,
        "text": "Core view only: other proton-associated reactions and the wider ATP network are not drawn."
      },
      "10": {
        "x": 75,
        "y": 1027,
        "text": "B. Test-only GPR shared by R794 and R795"
      },
      "11": {
        "x": 90,
        "y": 1067,
        "text": "AND across 12 shared candidates, then AND (a candidate 1 OR a candidate 2)"
      },
      "12": {
        "x": 90,
        "y": 1120,
        "text": "YALI1A11258g | V1 C / scaffold"
      },
      "13": {
        "x": 90,
        "y": 1159,
        "text": "YALI1E14125g | V1 G / stalk"
      },
      "14": {
        "x": 90,
        "y": 1198,
        "text": "YALI1D00581g | V1 D / shaft"
      },
      "15": {
        "x": 90,
        "y": 1237,
        "text": "YALI1E10492g | V1 H / regulation"
      },
      "16": {
        "x": 90,
        "y": 1276,
        "text": "YALI1A09766g | V1 A / ATP hydrolysis"
      },
      "17": {
        "x": 90,
        "y": 1315,
        "text": "YALI1F20965g | V1 E / stalk"
      },
      "18": {
        "x": 705,
        "y": 1120,
        "text": "YALI0E16192g | V1 F / shaft"
      },
      "19": {
        "x": 705,
        "y": 1159,
        "text": "YALI1F31854g | V0 proteolipid / rotor"
      },
      "20": {
        "x": 705,
        "y": 1198,
        "text": "YALI1F21690g | V0 d / coupling"
      },
      "21": {
        "x": 705,
        "y": 1237,
        "text": "YALI1E37063g | V0 proteolipid / rotor"
      },
      "22": {
        "x": 705,
        "y": 1276,
        "text": "YALI1E32332g | V1 B / nucleotide binding"
      },
      "23": {
        "x": 705,
        "y": 1315,
        "text": "YALI1F13017g | V0 c″ / rotor"
      },
      "24": {
        "x": 90,
        "y": 1383,
        "text": "AND (YALI1E12482g  OR  YALI1F38820g)"
      },
      "25": {
        "x": 90,
        "y": 1423,
        "text": "V0 a / proton channel"
      },
      "26": {
        "x": 590,
        "y": 1423,
        "text": "Vph1-like V0 a / proton channel"
      },
      "27": {
        "x": 90,
        "y": 1463,
        "text": "Native names unverified; homology / AlphaFold support, not experimental validation."
      },
      "28": {
        "x": 90,
        "y": 1500,
        "text": "a-subunit OR is a test hypothesis, not demonstrated same-compartment complementation."
      },
      "29": {
        "x": 1355,
        "y": 230,
        "text": "C. Why the screen does not change"
      },
      "30": {
        "x": 1370,
        "y": 274,
        "text": "Shared-component KO makes both pump GPRs false."
      },
      "31": {
        "x": 1370,
        "y": 311,
        "text": "R794: [0,1000] -> [0,0]; R795: already [0,0]."
      },
      "32": {
        "x": 1370,
        "y": 358,
        "text": "The complete saved WT flux remains feasible"
      },
      "33": {
        "x": 1370,
        "y": 395,
        "text": "after every target single knockout."
      },
      "34": {
        "x": 1370,
        "y": 442,
        "text": "The present constraints permit WT-level growth"
      },
      "35": {
        "x": 1370,
        "y": 479,
        "text": "without flux through either pump."
      },
      "36": {
        "x": 1370,
        "y": 530,
        "text": "ATP demand does not automatically require pump flux."
      },
      "37": {
        "x": 1370,
        "y": 566,
        "text": "Biomass uses ATP; its reaction has no H+ [go]/[va] term."
      },
      "38": {
        "x": 1355,
        "y": 640,
        "text": "D. What evidence is still missing?"
      },
      "39": {
        "x": 1370,
        "y": 696,
        "text": "1  Growth-linked acidification"
      },
      "40": {
        "x": 1370,
        "y": 735,
        "text": "A measured, condition-specific acidification need"
      },
      "41": {
        "x": 1370,
        "y": 768,
        "text": "and a supported mechanism linking it to growth."
      },
      "42": {
        "x": 1370,
        "y": 835,
        "text": "2  Proton transport energetics"
      },
      "43": {
        "x": 1370,
        "y": 874,
        "text": "Physiological direction and energy coupling of R1159."
      },
      "44": {
        "x": 1370,
        "y": 907,
        "text": "A possible alternative connection; not an active WT bypass."
      },
      "45": {
        "x": 1370,
        "y": 974,
        "text": "3  Native a-subunit localization"
      },
      "46": {
        "x": 1370,
        "y": 1013,
        "text": "Golgi/vacuolar localization and complementation"
      },
      "47": {
        "x": 1370,
        "y": 1046,
        "text": "for the two a candidates under the same conditions."
      },
      "48": {
        "x": 1370,
        "y": 1113,
        "text": "4  The W29 F-subunit identity"
      },
      "49": {
        "x": 1370,
        "y": 1152,
        "text": "Resolve the CLIB122 old-F / W29 locus conflict;"
      },
      "50": {
        "x": 1370,
        "y": 1185,
        "text": "confirm an intact, expressed native protein."
      },
      "51": {
        "x": 1370,
        "y": 1252,
        "text": "5  Native complex assembly"
      },
      "52": {
        "x": 1370,
        "y": 1291,
        "text": "Complete subunit stoichiometry and orthogonal evidence."
      },
      "53": {
        "x": 1370,
        "y": 1324,
        "text": "AlphaFold predictions alone do not validate function."
      },
      "54": {
        "x": 1370,
        "y": 1439,
        "text": "Do not add an arbitrary sink merely to force essentiality."
      },
      "55": {
        "x": 1370,
